      "control_id": "A.11.1",
      "title": "Privacy compliance monitoring",
      "description": "The cloud service provider shall conduct regular privacy compliance assessments including DPIA support, privacy impact assessments of new processing activities, and periodic audits against applicable privacy regulations. Findings shall be tracked and remediated.",
