      "control_id": "A.11.2",
      "title": "Cross-border data transfer controls",
      "description": "Transfers of PII to countries outside the originating jurisdiction shall be subject to appropriate safeguards. Applicable mechanisms include: adequacy decisions, standard contractual clauses (SCCs), binding corporate rules (BCRs), and approved certification schemes. Transfer impact assessments shall be conducted for high-risk transfers.",
